# `Reflect.set(o, "a", v)`, `Reflect.deleteProperty(o, "b")`: the key is written. The other fields are neither stored over nor deleted.
# RUN: summary f0
# CHECK: access {{*}}Store {{*}}"a"
# CHECK: change {{*}}Deletes {{*}}"b"
# RUN(HELD): link held fields mechanisms=all
# HELD: "c" proven=i32 writers-known written-at-construction-alone
# RUN(ALL): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
# ALL: string undefined number
# ALL-NEXT: exited with 0
